# Health & liveness — API.md §Health & telemetry
#
# Unauthenticated by default. `[api] metrics_public = false` puts both this and
# /metrics behind the API key, which the last request here checks.

@base = {{host}}

### Liveness. `status` is "ok" or "degraded" (every upstream failing —
### serve-stale is carrying the traffic). This is what the container
### HEALTHCHECK probes via `fastadhunter --healthcheck`.
GET {{base}}/health

### Same endpoint with a key. Sending one when none is required is harmless —
### useful for confirming a key is valid without mutating anything.
GET {{base}}/health
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Unknown route — expect 404 in the documented error envelope
### { "error": { "code": "not_found", "message": "..." } }.
GET {{base}}/health/nope
